From e4b3f950de45a9d31dd842452b9c0d5ad43eb120 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dacz8976-creator <dacz8976@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:35:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Limit Heavy Helmet, Harden, Hide and Blocking Shell to attack
 damage
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Heavy Helmet ("takes -20 damage from attacks from your opponent's
Pokémon"), Cascoon's Harden and Carracosta's Blocking Shell ("by
attacks"), and Shinx's Hide ("from—and effects of—attacks") are all
limited to damage from attacks. modify_damage applied them to every kind
of damage instead: Poison, Burn, Ability damage such as Darkrai's Bad
Dreams, Tool damage, and, for Heavy Helmet, attacks from the holder's own
player.

Gate them on is_from_active_attack, and Heavy Helmet also on the attacker
being the opponent, the same way Steel Apron and Metal Core Barrier are
already gated.

Adds tests/rules/attack_damage_only_test.rs: one test per card, plus one
showing Steel Apron and Metal Core Barrier are unchanged.
---
